<div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap flex-md-nowrap align-items-center pt-3 pb-2 mb-4 border-bottom border-light">
    <h1 class="h2 fw-bold text-dark">Sistem & Pengaturan</h1>
</div>




<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card shadow-sm h-100 border-0">
            <div class="card-header bg-white border-0 pt-4 pb-0 px-4">
                <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-dark mb-0"><i class="bi bi-database-fill-gear text-primary me-2"></i> Sinkronisasi Database</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body p-4 text-secondary">
                <p>Fitur ini akan menyesuaikan struktur tabel <code class="bg-light px-2 py-1 rounded text-primary">warga</code> di MySQL dengan definisi yang ada di <code class="bg-light px-2 py-1 rounded text-primary">form-schema.json</code>.</p>
                <ul class="mb-4">
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle text-success me-2"></i> Menambah kolom baru jika ada field baru di JSON.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-dash-circle text-danger me-2"></i> Menghapus kolom jika field tidak ada di JSON <strong>DAN</strong> kolom tersebut kosong (tidak ada data).</li>
                    <li><i class="bi bi-shield-check text-info me-2"></i> Menjaga kolom yang berisi data meskipun field sudah dihapus dari JSON.</li>
                </ul>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary shadow-sm rounded-pill px-4 py-2 fw-medium" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#syncModal">
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-2"></i> Sinkronkan Sekarang
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
        <div class="card shadow-sm h-100 border-0">
            <div class="card-header bg-white border-0 pt-4 pb-0 px-4">
                <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-dark mb-0"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-code-fill text-info me-2"></i> Status Form Schema</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item px-0 py-3 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center border-light">
                        <span class="text-secondary">Judul Form</span>
                        <span class="fw-semibold text-dark"><%= schema.title %></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-group-item px-0 py-3 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center border-light">
                        <span class="text-secondary">Versi/ID</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border px-2 py-1 rounded-pill"><%= schema.formId %></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-group-item px-0 py-3 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center border-light">
                        <span class="text-secondary">Total Section</span>
                        <span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill px-3 py-2"><%= schema.sections.length %> Sections</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-group-item px-0 py-3 border-light">
                        <span class="text-secondary d-block mb-2">Deskripsi</span>
                        <p class="text-dark small mb-0 p-3 bg-light rounded-3"><%= schema.description %></p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Sync Confirmation Modal -->
<div class="modal fade" id="syncModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
        <form action="/admin/system/sync-schema" method="POST" class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg rounded-4 overflow-hidden">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
            <div class="modal-header bg-light border-bottom-0 pt-4 pb-3 px-4">
                <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill text-danger me-2"></i> Konfirmasi Keamanan</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close bg-secondary bg-opacity-10 rounded-circle" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body px-4 py-4">
                <p class="text-secondary small mb-4">Operasi sinkronisasi dapat memodifikasi struktur database (menambah/menghapus kolom). Silakan masukkan password administrator Anda untuk memvalidasi aksi ini.</p>
                <div class="mb-2">
                    <label class="form-label fw-medium text-secondary small">Password <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                    <div class="input-group shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                        <span class="input-group-text bg-white border-end-0 text-primary"><i class="bi bi-lock"></i></span>
                        <input type="password" name="password" class="form-control border-start-0 ps-0 bg-white" placeholder="Masukkan password Anda" required autofocus>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top-0 pt-3 pb-4 px-4">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light border-0 shadow-sm rounded-pill px-4 fw-medium text-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Batal</button>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger shadow-sm rounded-pill px-4 fw-medium"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i> Konfirmasi Eksekusi</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
